# Regear: after a death and a looted corpse, heals, puts the suit back on, sorts the
# backpack and turns the aspects back on.
# Needs: restock/loadout run once this Razor session, it records the suit.
# The supply pouch and the loot bag back in the backpack, else the kit stays loose.
# Arcane Essence for the aspects, 5 each.
# Hotkeys: Bandage Self, Drink Heal, > Greater Heal/Cure Self, Cancel Current Target.
# Generated from recipe/regear-recipe.razor by util/build-scripts.mjs. Edit module/ and recipe/, not this file.


